#   - "this file will need a decision on the finding." That decision was taken
#     in #337 and is recorded at the entry itself: accept the four known
#     findings by fingerprint so a FIFTH leak is visible, and remove them when
#     Part B rewrites the history. Nothing about it makes the secret safe.
#
#   - The blast-radius figures below (393 commits on `main`, 8 remote branches,
#     59 of 60 tags, 0 open PRs) were measured on 2026-09-04 and have grown.
