#
#   - And the single source for every commit count is that table, not this
#     header. If the two ever disagree, the table wins and the disagreement is
#     itself the bug. Not hypothetical: three "18 commits" claims outlived the
#     retraction below by five days inside that very runbook — #401 rewrote the
#     file around them without touching them — and were removed on 2026-09-09.
